OL,3,GNEWSACommunity celebrates snapping up
OL,4,Abeloved 'church in the glen'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA south of Scotland community is
OL,7,Fcelebrating after it completed the
OL,8,Fpurchase of its "church in the glen" to
OL,9,Fsave it from potentially falling into
OL,10,Fprivate hands.
OL,12,FIn less than a year since it closed,
OL,13,Fthe Friends of Wamphray Church (FWC)
OL,14,Fraised more than #45,000 to buy it from
OL,15,Fthe Church of Scotland.
OL,17,FA public appeal attracted donations
OL,18,Ffrom all over the UK as well as the US
OL,19,Fand Canada and a grant from Clyde Wind
OL,20,FFarm and SSE Renewables.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
