OL,3,GNEWSACommunity celebrates snapping up
OL,4,Abeloved 'church in the glen'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCarol Beattie, who chairs FWC, said the
OL,7,Fsite could now "continue to be loved
OL,8,Fand cared for - today and for years to
OL,9,Fcome".
